-- Spec 02.5: the DESNZ 2025 conversion factors join the catalogue as a second
-- PUBLISHED edition of the defra family, applying from 1 January 2025, so a
-- 2025 reporting year has factors of its own vintage (spec 02.9).
-- Generated once from the DESNZ 2025 flat file by the same conversion that
-- built defra-2026 for V43; never edit it by hand, as Flyway checksums the file
-- and a published edition's values never change.
--
-- The evidence checksum is the SHA-256 of the flat file itself
-- (ghg-conversion-factors-2025-flat-format.xlsx, 505634 bytes). The curator
-- reads as the seed and there is no approver, which
-- chk_ghg_factor_pack_editions_published allows only while provenance_review
-- is SEED_UNCHECKED: a verifier can see that the rows were not independently
-- checked against the publication. An edition authored in the console can
-- never carry that value.

-- The 1928 rows, in the order the flat file lists them.








-- The publication trail of a seeded edition: one entry saying where it came from.
VALUES (gen_random_uuid(), 'defra-2025', 'PUBLISHED', NULL,
        'Seeded by V54 from the DESNZ 2025 flat file; not checked against the publication');
